        "created_at": "2015-02-04T17:23:53.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I know the game isn’t built for these, but has anyone tried these? If so, with which and how many heroes? What worked well? What didn’t?</p>\n<p>I’m going to try these soon and would like advice before I start. I really want to try the FF vs. PW, but figure I should start 3 on 3 with, say, Parse,Tachyon and Chrono Ranger vs. Legacy, Visionary, and Fanatic. Thoughts?</p>",
