        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/platinumwarlock/{size}/1869_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-02-04T18:55:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Pydro\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pydro/48/1844_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Pydro:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I think we had a forum game like this once, and I didn't go well.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>We did–I was in that game. &nbsp;It was kind of…well, unfair for certain characters is putting it nicely. &nbsp;Un-tactfully, it was kind of a train-wreck. &nbsp;</p>\n<p>The game would need a number of big house rules to make PvP viable in the base SotM game.</p>",
